Environment variables to set. 


# Env required by the layer mssqlserver-datasource
# MSSQLSERVER_DATABASE=Defines the database name to be used in the datasource’s `connection-url` property.
# MSSQLSERVER_JNDI=java:jboss/datasources/InventarioDS
# MSSQLSERVER_PASSWORD=Defines the password for the datasource.
# MSSQLSERVER_USER=Defines the username for the datasource.

